WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit and bend the right knee so the shin is in front.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Swing the left leg behind with the knee bent.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Sit evenly on both sit bones.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Optional: gentle twist toward the front leg.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
